-- ============================================================
-- SNS NDT — Final Assessment question banks (Level I, all 6 methods)
-- AUTO-GENERATED. Run AFTER all e-learning + module1 seeds.
-- Links 40 questions to each method's FINAL ASSESSMENT quiz step via LessonStepId.
